## Protection-Window Fees Will Be Burnt

Gene does not intend to profit from the protection window.

**Any protection-window trading fees received and controlled by Gene will be used to buy GOTE on the open market (via the revenue wallet) and burn it, and the burn will be publicly verifiable on-chain.**

Two honest qualifications:

Protocol or third-party fees that never enter Gene's control cannot be burned by Gene.

Fees are not separated on-chain by when they were earned — they accumulate in a single pool balance. Identifying the protection-window portion means reading the trades that occurred inside the window and summing their fee component.

**If the protection window works as intended, no one trades during it and there is nothing to burn.** Discouraging malicious activity is the goal.

Normal trading fees generated after the protection window are separate and Gene's configured share routes to the publicly disclosed revenue wallet.

